{"unit_id":"qiz42144-web__dsh-ai-curfew#card-zh","repo":"qiz42144-web/dsh-ai-curfew","commit":"bbddf15f55fce341aa517119a0ea14fa1426ea7d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"AI Curfew（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：按本地时区的工作日峰谷班表和夜间宵禁调整 AI 的工作状态。它接入模型流、请求参数、系统提示词和工具执行流程，并提供 /curfew 命令、侧栏状态胶囊与设置页。主要功能包括逐步缩减夜间 token 预算、高峰时段用预设短回复代替模型请求、熄灯后停止工具调用，以及临时加班或手动下班。适合希望按时段控制 DSH 回复和调用的用户。可选配置存放在 DSH_HOME 指定的数据目录中，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-499","index.js:507-538","index.js:568-582","client.js:501-523"]}
{"unit_id":"qiz42144-web__dsh-ai-curfew#card-en","repo":"qiz42144-web/dsh-ai-curfew","commit":"bbddf15f55fce341aa517119a0ea14fa1426ea7d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"AI Curfew (DSH web plugin) schedules peak hours and a nightly curfew. It reduces request budgets, blocks tools, and returns preset replies without model calls after hours. Use /curfew to manage overrides; a sidebar capsule and settings page show status. Hours and replies are configurable locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-499","index.js:507-538","index.js:568-582","client.js:501-523"]}
